OL,3,GNEWSA'Fact-finding mission' as village
OL,4,Aconsiders referendum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second parish council is considering
OL,7,Fholding a symbolic independence
OL,8,Freferendum in response to proposals to
OL,9,Fhouse asylum seekers on a nearby RAF
OL,10,Fbase.
OL,12,FVillagers in Piddington in Oxfordshire
OL,13,Fvoted to become independent from the UK
OL,14,Fon 15 September in response to plans to
OL,15,Fhouse asylum seekers at MoD Bicester.
OL,17,FThe chairman of Barnham Parish Council
OL,18,Fin Suffolk, John Bauer, says his
OL,19,Fvillage is considering a similar vote
OL,20,Fand a "small group" will travel to
OL,21,FPiddington on Tuesday to meet
OL,22,Fcampaigners.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
