OL,3,GNEWSA'Fact-finding mission' as village
OL,4,Aconsiders referendum
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's really a fact-finding mission to
OL,7,Ffind out a bit more about exactly what
OL,8,Fthey've done, how effective it's all
OL,9,Fbeen and whether that's something we
OL,10,Fwould want to do in Barnham," he said.
